{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q114538","formula":"Fe₂Si","hill":"Fe2Si","elements":["Si","Fe"],"composition":{"Fe":2.0,"Si":1.0},"names":{"en":"Hapkeite","uk":"Гапкеїт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Hapkeite is a mineral discovered in the Dhofar 280 meteorite found in 2000 in Oman on the Arabian Peninsula. The meteorite is believed to originate from the Moon; specifically, it appears to be a fragment of lunar highland breccia. Hapkeite's composition is of silicon and iron, and it is similar to other silicon-iron minerals found on Earth.","uk":"Гапкеїт — мінерал, виявлений у метеориті Dhofar 280, знайденому в 2000 році в Омані на Аравійському півострові. Вважається, що метеорит походить з Місяця; зокрема, це, здається, уламок місячної високогірної брекчії. Мінерал складається з кремнію та заліза, і він схожий на інші кремнієво-залізні мінерали, знайдені на Землі."},"fame":13,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"crystal","source":"materialsproject","ref":"mp-22787","atoms":43,"license":"CC BY 4.0, Materials Project"},"structure":{"cell":[[3.9,0.0,0.0],[-1.95,3.377,0.0],[0.0,0.0,4.817]],"kind":"crystal","atoms":[{"x":0.0,"y":2.252,"z":3.271,"el":"Fe"},{"x":1.95,"y":1.126,"z":1.546,"el":"Fe"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":2.409,"el":"Fe"},{"x":-3.9,"y":6.755,"z":2.409,"el":"Fe"},{"x":7.8,"y":0.0,"z":2.409,"el":"Fe"},{"x":3.9,"y":6.755,"z":2.409,"el":"Fe"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"Fe"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":4.817,"el":"Fe"},{"x":-3.9,"y":6.755,"z":0.0,"el":"Fe"},{"x":-3.9,"y":6.755,"z":4.817,"el":"Fe"},{"x":7.8,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"Fe"},{"x":7.8,"y":0.0,"z":4.817,"el":"Fe"},{"x":3.9,"y":6.755,"z":0.0,"el":"Fe"},{"x":3.9,"y":6.755,"z":4.817,"el":"Fe"},{"x":1.95,"y":1.126,"z":3.945,"el":"Si"},{"x":0.0,"y":2.252,"z":0.873,"el":"Si"},{"x":-1.95,"y":5.629,"z":3.271,"el":"Fe"},{"x":0.0,"y":